  |= name |= meaning |
  | participant | one live causal branch of a reducer evaluation |
  | intent | a typed request for one RSpace produce or consume |
  | complete frontier | the point at which every live participant waits on one intent or has completed |
  | footprint, [2, 0] | the resources that an intent can touch, and the common key that native execution adds to every footprint |
  | conflict component | a connected component of intents whose footprints intersect |
  | native deploy | an offered (v6) deploy under the native cost meter. Legacy deploys bypass the queue. |
  | COMM | one RSpace communication event: a send that matches a receive |
